<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Schroder raises Pfizer.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Schroder raises Pfizer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder &amp; Co Inc analyst Jami Rubin said Monday she had raised Pfizer Inc from a buy to a strong-buy rating, adding Pfizer to Schroder's recommended list of stocks.</p>
<p>-- said based on projected strong sales beginning in 1998.</p>
</text>
